    "title": "GATEWAY-apiwizdoc-Create Telecom Sim Replacement-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM Replacement API facilitates the seamless process of replacing existing SIM cards for users within the telecommunications network. This endpoint allows service providers to initiate SIM replacements, ensuring that customers can upgrade or recover their services efficiently. Typical consumers of this API include telecom operators and customer support applications, aiming to improve user satisfaction and service continuity. By providing a straightforward method for managing SIM replacements, it supports an agile response to customer needs and operational demands.",
